1
00:01:30,340 --> 00:01:33,578
=Against The Current=

2
00:01:33,579 --> 00:01:35,000
(Adapted from He Yanshan's novel,
Orchid Fragrance Fate)

3
00:01:35,180 --> 00:01:36,920
=Episode 4=
(This drama does not correspond)

4
00:01:36,930 --> 00:01:38,200
(to any real historical dynasty.)

5
00:01:38,210 --> 00:01:41,110
(The systems, culture, attire and other
dynastic elements have been adapted.)

6
00:01:41,439 --> 00:01:42,439
Starting today,

7
00:01:43,519 --> 00:01:45,640
you are third-class maids
of Zhichun Hall.

8
00:01:46,472 --> 00:01:48,040
Your monthly allowance is 500 coins.

9
00:01:49,079 --> 00:01:50,400
Four of you will share a room.

10
00:01:50,904 --> 00:01:52,936
You'll each receive
two sets of clothes per season.

11
00:01:53,799 --> 00:01:56,799
Food, clothing, lodging, and travel

12
00:01:57,519 --> 00:01:58,599
must all follow the rules.

13
00:01:59,840 --> 00:02:01,599
- Yes, Qingxiang.
- Yes, Qingxiang.

14
00:02:06,719 --> 00:02:07,640
This room

15
00:02:07,920 --> 00:02:09,199
needs someone in charge.

16
00:02:09,919 --> 00:02:10,520
Who'll do it?

17
00:02:22,680 --> 00:02:23,599
Qingxiang,

18
00:02:23,919 --> 00:02:24,960
how about me?

19
00:02:26,919 --> 00:02:27,719
All right.

20
00:02:28,552 --> 00:02:30,000
From now on, everyone in this room

21
00:02:30,199 --> 00:02:31,240
will listen to Ji'er.

22
00:02:33,639 --> 00:02:34,360
Follow me.

23
00:02:39,208 --> 00:02:40,360
A tyrant at home.

24
00:02:52,104 --> 00:02:53,910
This is where
the second-class maids live.

25
00:02:54,560 --> 00:02:55,599
Two to a room.

26
00:02:55,919 --> 00:02:58,000
Their monthly allowance is 800 coins.

27
00:02:59,159 --> 00:02:59,879
Someday,

28
00:03:00,520 --> 00:03:02,919
I hope I can become a second-class maid.

29
00:03:04,280 --> 00:03:05,800
Work hard and do your duties well,

30
00:03:05,879 --> 00:03:07,240
and your dream will come true.

31
00:04:00,168 --> 00:04:01,360
(Jinzhan, Second-Class Maid)

32
00:04:01,360 --> 00:04:02,280
(of Zhichun Hall)
Qingxiang.

33
00:04:04,840 --> 00:04:05,639
Yingge.

34
00:04:06,136 --> 00:04:07,800
You said you know how to tend flowers.

35
00:04:08,360 --> 00:04:10,439
Jinzhan is in charge
of the plants here.

36
00:04:10,560 --> 00:04:11,639
Starting today,

37
00:04:11,840 --> 00:04:13,159
you'll work under her.

38
00:04:13,400 --> 00:04:14,360
No slacking off.

39
00:04:16,519 --> 00:04:17,079
Yes.

40
00:04:19,839 --> 00:04:20,519
The rest of you,

41
00:04:21,160 --> 00:04:21,800
come with me.

42
00:04:44,639 --> 00:04:45,399
Xiaolian.

43
00:04:47,752 --> 00:04:49,510
Since you don't know
how to do anything yet,

44
00:04:50,160 --> 00:04:52,040
start by helping out
in the small kitchen.

45
00:04:52,560 --> 00:04:53,736
Whatever they tell you to do,

46
00:04:53,879 --> 00:04:54,800
do it.

47
00:05:02,279 --> 00:05:02,879
Yes.

48
00:05:03,480 --> 00:05:04,519
Thank you, Qingxiang.

49
00:05:06,199 --> 00:05:06,759
Follow me.

50
00:05:15,839 --> 00:05:16,480
Baogai.

51
00:05:19,680 --> 00:05:20,480
Qingxiang.

52
00:05:23,240 --> 00:05:24,480
This is the tea room.

53
00:05:24,959 --> 00:05:26,079
Baogai is in charge here.

54
00:05:29,100 --> 00:05:31,560
(Baogai,
Second-Class Maid of Zhichun Hall)

55
00:05:31,560 --> 00:05:34,200
You two will start by learning
to tend the stove and boil water.

56
00:05:34,240 --> 00:05:35,040
Remember,

57
00:05:35,096 --> 00:05:37,000
there must always
be hot water in the kettle

58
00:05:37,279 --> 00:05:38,160
so the masters can

59
00:05:38,160 --> 00:05:39,720
have tea
or wash up whenever they need.

60
00:05:39,839 --> 00:05:40,680
Don't let it go cold.

61
00:05:43,304 --> 00:05:45,120
Don't touch
the tea leaves or medicinal herbs

62
00:05:45,120 --> 00:05:46,079
in the cabinet.

63
00:05:46,536 --> 00:05:48,600
If even
the smallest amount goes missing,

64
00:05:48,839 --> 00:05:49,920
you'll be held responsible.

65
00:05:52,079 --> 00:05:53,199
- Yes.
- Yes.

66
00:05:56,680 --> 00:05:58,360
As if we'd steal from the masters.

67
00:06:09,120 --> 00:06:10,439
You're third-class maids.

68
00:06:10,456 --> 00:06:12,760
You're not qualified
to serve the masters personally.

69
00:06:14,600 --> 00:06:16,190
Keep your heads down and do your work.

70
00:06:16,360 --> 00:06:17,560
Don't get any improper ideas.

71
00:06:18,399 --> 00:06:19,079
Otherwise,

72
00:06:19,600 --> 00:06:20,879
don't blame me for being harsh.

73
00:06:25,000 --> 00:06:25,839
Take care.

74
00:06:27,976 --> 00:06:29,870
What's wrong
with being third-class maids?

75
00:06:29,920 --> 00:06:31,720
First Madam
personally asked for us to...

76
00:06:34,079 --> 00:06:35,000
Get to work.

77
00:06:36,480 --> 00:06:37,920
Clean all the stoves inside.

78
00:06:39,439 --> 00:06:40,240
Hurry.

79
00:06:44,800 --> 00:06:45,480
Baogai,

80
00:06:45,480 --> 00:06:46,480
I'll fetch the water.

81
00:07:36,079 --> 00:07:37,360
(Zijin, Zhao Xingtang's)
Young Lady is upset.

82
00:07:37,360 --> 00:07:38,240
(First-Class Maid)

83
00:07:38,240 --> 00:07:39,439
She's throwing a tantrum.

84
00:08:08,968 --> 00:08:09,680
Young Lady.

85
00:08:10,088 --> 00:08:11,870
Counting your silver
to calm yourself again?

86
00:08:14,000 --> 00:08:14,959
In this Lin Residence,

87
00:08:17,480 --> 00:08:18,959
this is the only thing I find lovable.

88
00:08:26,199 --> 00:08:27,839
Only when I see it

89
00:08:28,720 --> 00:08:30,680
can I endure

90
00:08:30,920 --> 00:08:32,320
another day in this prison.

91
00:08:50,480 --> 00:08:52,080
I've met all four women

92
00:08:52,080 --> 00:08:53,320
First Madam sent over.

93
00:08:54,240 --> 00:08:56,320
Yingge is calm and composed.

94
00:08:56,919 --> 00:08:59,679
Someone like her is either on our side

95
00:09:00,200 --> 00:09:01,320
or against us.

96
00:09:01,919 --> 00:09:04,200
Xiaolian is lively.

97
00:09:05,000 --> 00:09:06,519
Just as she said,

98
00:09:06,559 --> 00:09:07,919
all she thinks about is food.

99
00:09:09,159 --> 00:09:10,480
Lanxiang...

100
00:09:13,720 --> 00:09:15,320
is as guileless as Xiaolian,

101
00:09:16,039 --> 00:09:17,360
but more timid.

102
00:09:19,200 --> 00:09:20,000
As for Ji'er,

103
00:09:22,000 --> 00:09:23,240
she certainly is ambitious.

104
00:09:29,550 --> 00:09:31,608
First Madam despises me
for not bearing children,

105
00:09:32,519 --> 00:09:35,519
so she wants them
to bear heirs for the Lin family.

106
00:09:38,216 --> 00:09:39,530
If I really had to choose someone

107
00:09:39,544 --> 00:09:41,240
to bear Lin Jinqi a child,

108
00:09:45,279 --> 00:09:46,360
I'd rather choose you.

109
00:09:47,039 --> 00:09:47,840
Young Lady,

110
00:09:48,799 --> 00:09:49,759
I don't want to.

111
00:09:55,360 --> 00:09:56,519
Even if you agreed,

112
00:09:56,960 --> 00:09:58,559
Lin Jinqi wouldn't.

113
00:10:02,679 --> 00:10:03,639
He wants the child

114
00:10:04,600 --> 00:10:05,679
to bear the Lin name,

115
00:10:07,000 --> 00:10:08,240
not the Zhao name.

116
00:10:15,799 --> 00:10:16,399
Then

117
00:10:18,039 --> 00:10:19,559
what do you plan to do?

118
00:10:26,399 --> 00:10:27,200
What can I do?

119
00:10:30,240 --> 00:10:31,480
I'm just a woman.

120
00:10:32,799 --> 00:10:34,399
I can't go to the academy,

121
00:10:36,159 --> 00:10:37,919
nor can I make something of myself.

122
00:10:39,600 --> 00:10:40,879
All I can do is save money

123
00:10:44,240 --> 00:10:45,720
and find another way out.

124
00:10:56,279 --> 00:10:58,919
Lanxiang's sachet is already worn out.

125
00:11:00,480 --> 00:11:02,279
I've finished sewing her a new one.

126
00:11:03,039 --> 00:11:05,519
I was going to wait
for an auspicious day to give it to her.

127
00:11:08,000 --> 00:11:09,639
That girl's embroidery

128
00:11:11,559 --> 00:11:12,720
is always so lovely.

129
00:11:16,279 --> 00:11:17,559
She'd surely say again

130
00:11:18,600 --> 00:11:20,639
that I'm like
a mother admiring her daughter,

131
00:11:21,559 --> 00:11:24,279
so everything
she does looks wonderful to me.

132
00:11:26,440 --> 00:11:28,159
But really, she's the one

133
00:11:29,600 --> 00:11:30,960
who cheers me up every day.

134
00:11:34,399 --> 00:11:35,720
If it hadn't been for her

135
00:11:37,720 --> 00:11:39,279
giving me the will to carry on,

136
00:11:43,559 --> 00:11:44,919
perhaps six years ago,

137
00:11:45,480 --> 00:11:47,039
I would've followed our daughter

138
00:11:47,639 --> 00:11:48,480
into the next world.

139
00:11:53,840 --> 00:11:55,519
What can we even do for her?

140
00:11:57,519 --> 00:11:59,919
All we've done is burden her
by making her serve others.

141
00:12:01,159 --> 00:12:02,120
Even now,

142
00:12:02,759 --> 00:12:04,039
we don't know which household

143
00:12:04,120 --> 00:12:05,279
she's been assigned to

144
00:12:05,519 --> 00:12:06,600
or what work she's doing.

145
00:12:07,360 --> 00:12:09,600
I wonder if anyone is mistreating her.

146
00:12:23,440 --> 00:12:25,279
What are you doing?

147
00:12:32,519 --> 00:12:33,320
Look.

148
00:12:35,384 --> 00:12:36,960
Do you still remember this character?

149
00:12:39,879 --> 00:12:41,840
It looks a little familiar.

150
00:12:44,360 --> 00:12:45,519
"Live."

151
00:12:49,240 --> 00:12:50,320
"Live?"

152
00:12:50,420 --> 00:12:57,000
(Live)

153
00:12:57,000 --> 00:12:58,679
Wasn't this

154
00:12:59,304 --> 00:13:00,990
the last thing
Lanxiang's mother left her?

155
00:13:01,720 --> 00:13:03,879
And it's also what Lanxiang gave us.

156
00:13:04,399 --> 00:13:05,000
She said

157
00:13:05,480 --> 00:13:07,320
no matter
which household she's assigned to,

158
00:13:07,840 --> 00:13:09,279
no matter what work she has to do,

159
00:13:09,279 --> 00:13:11,440
she'll live on and live well.

160
00:13:11,799 --> 00:13:13,720
So you need
to pull yourself together, too,

161
00:13:13,840 --> 00:13:15,240
and live well.

162
00:13:19,919 --> 00:13:21,279
Mind your own business.

163
00:13:23,080 --> 00:13:24,919
My life is as tough as a weed.

164
00:13:25,279 --> 00:13:26,480
I've seen it all.

165
00:13:27,480 --> 00:13:28,679
The harder life tramples me,

166
00:13:29,120 --> 00:13:30,639
the stronger I grow.

167
00:13:36,320 --> 00:13:37,360
Stay put and rest.

168
00:13:38,320 --> 00:13:39,200
Your hands are filthy.

169
00:13:41,480 --> 00:13:43,200
I don't have time to keep getting sick.

170
00:13:44,080 --> 00:13:45,919
I still need to save money for Lanxiang.

171
00:13:45,919 --> 00:13:47,940
♪Flowers bloom again by the fence♪

172
00:13:48,300 --> 00:13:52,060
♪Snow falls white upon the eaves♪

173
00:13:54,120 --> 00:13:56,480
Slow down.

174
00:13:57,260 --> 00:14:00,460
♪Whose footsteps come and go?♪

175
00:14:03,000 --> 00:14:03,759
Persimmons!

176
00:14:04,120 --> 00:14:05,279
These are fresh.

177
00:14:05,360 --> 00:14:06,879
Look how fresh they are.

178
00:14:10,480 --> 00:14:11,279
Persimmons!

179
00:14:11,559 --> 00:14:13,759
Beautiful and delicious
rouge persimmons!

180
00:14:13,759 --> 00:14:18,140
♪People gather, then part♪

181
00:14:28,840 --> 00:14:30,159
Lanxiang, hurry up.

182
00:14:30,200 --> 00:14:31,704
Everyone's waiting for your charcoal.

183
00:14:54,399 --> 00:14:55,080
You two,

184
00:14:55,288 --> 00:14:56,780
one takes the first half of the night,

185
00:14:56,792 --> 00:14:58,216
and the other takes the second half.

186
00:14:58,360 --> 00:14:59,399
The fire mustn't go out.

187
00:14:59,400 --> 00:15:00,830
There must always
be hot water in the kettle.

188
00:15:00,840 --> 00:15:01,639
Yes.

189
00:15:03,320 --> 00:15:04,080
Yes.

190
00:15:07,128 --> 00:15:08,936
How many times have you said that?

191
00:15:09,032 --> 00:15:09,840
Aren't you tired?

192
00:15:17,759 --> 00:15:19,480
I'm exhausted after working all day.

193
00:15:20,000 --> 00:15:20,639
I need a rest.

194
00:15:22,679 --> 00:15:24,159
Bring a pot of water to our room.

195
00:15:24,184 --> 00:15:25,848
We've been serving
Young Madam all day.

196
00:15:25,928 --> 00:15:27,690
We're exhausted
and want to soak our feet.

197
00:15:27,759 --> 00:15:29,580
(Lucao,
Second-Class Maid of Zhichun Hall)

198
00:15:35,720 --> 00:15:36,720
I'll take it over.

199
00:15:37,039 --> 00:15:38,279
I'll go back and get some sleep.

200
00:15:38,488 --> 00:15:40,120
I'll come relieve you after midnight.

201
00:15:49,639 --> 00:15:50,200
Hurry.

202
00:15:50,440 --> 00:15:51,720
Young Madam needs hot water.

203
00:15:52,360 --> 00:15:53,720
Why is there nothing on the stove?

204
00:15:54,984 --> 00:15:56,840
What have you been doing?
If Young Madam holds

205
00:15:56,879 --> 00:15:59,000
you responsible, can you
bear the consequences?

206
00:16:08,279 --> 00:16:09,360
The water we boiled earlier

207
00:16:09,360 --> 00:16:10,808
is right here for when we need it.

208
00:16:11,080 --> 00:16:12,584
It's just the right temperature now.

209
00:16:12,616 --> 00:16:14,280
Hurry and boil some more water.

210
00:18:06,200 --> 00:18:07,000
Father,

211
00:18:08,440 --> 00:18:11,519
my hands are covered in charcoal dust,
just like yours.

212
00:18:13,720 --> 00:18:15,599
Mother would nag me again if she saw.

213
00:18:42,440 --> 00:18:43,240
(Lanxiang,)

214
00:18:44,119 --> 00:18:45,400
(Father will remember.)

215
00:18:46,720 --> 00:18:48,000
(Live well.)

216
00:18:49,559 --> 00:18:51,160
(Let's all live well.)

217
00:19:15,799 --> 00:19:17,160
I slept right through,

218
00:19:17,160 --> 00:19:18,559
and you didn't even wake me.

219
00:19:19,480 --> 00:19:20,759
Baogai said

220
00:19:20,760 --> 00:19:22,648
someone has to stay
by the stove at all times.

221
00:19:23,119 --> 00:19:24,200
I didn't dare leave.

222
00:19:25,928 --> 00:19:27,480
If you're too timid to get any sleep,

223
00:19:27,480 --> 00:19:28,519
you can't blame me.

224
00:19:29,720 --> 00:19:31,160
No one needed water during the night,

225
00:19:31,440 --> 00:19:32,640
so I kept dozing off, too.

226
00:19:32,880 --> 00:19:33,839
I'm not sleepy at all.

227
00:19:35,799 --> 00:19:37,279
Must be nice for you.

228
00:19:38,039 --> 00:19:40,279
Our room was freezing last night.

229
00:19:40,280 --> 00:19:42,488
Even in my dreams,
I was looking for a fire to warm up.

230
00:19:50,000 --> 00:19:50,759
These accounts

231
00:19:52,279 --> 00:19:53,200
are well kept.

232
00:19:54,519 --> 00:19:55,920
There isn't a single error.

233
00:19:56,664 --> 00:19:58,616
Thank you for your praise, Young Master.

234
00:19:59,759 --> 00:20:01,079
Your only son

235
00:20:01,384 --> 00:20:03,288
must be
of marriageable age now, isn't he?

236
00:20:03,720 --> 00:20:05,119
Thank you for asking, Young Master.

237
00:20:06,079 --> 00:20:07,480
He's already married.

238
00:20:08,000 --> 00:20:09,160
Whose daughter

239
00:20:09,240 --> 00:20:10,664
was lucky enough to marry him?

240
00:20:12,400 --> 00:20:13,839
Her name is Lancao.

241
00:20:18,160 --> 00:20:21,160
She was Young Madam's dowry maid.

242
00:20:23,160 --> 00:20:25,000
She is indeed fortunate.

243
00:20:25,519 --> 00:20:27,480
It's all thanks to you, Young Master.

244
00:20:47,079 --> 00:20:47,519
Please...

245
00:20:48,720 --> 00:20:49,559
Please, Young Master,

246
00:20:49,759 --> 00:20:51,559
spare me.

247
00:20:55,559 --> 00:20:58,599
Are there any errors
in these account books?

248
00:20:59,624 --> 00:21:02,430
We have fine Hangzhou white chrysanthemums
right here in the residence,

249
00:21:02,440 --> 00:21:03,960
yet she insists we pick them fresh,

250
00:21:03,960 --> 00:21:05,279
calling it an elegant pastime.

251
00:21:05,559 --> 00:21:08,119
I think Qingxiang is just showing off

252
00:21:08,119 --> 00:21:09,119
and making work for us.

253
00:21:09,359 --> 00:21:11,839
She's obviously a maid just like us,

254
00:21:11,960 --> 00:21:13,519
but just because she can read a little,

255
00:21:14,079 --> 00:21:16,160
she puts on airs like a young lady.

256
00:21:16,440 --> 00:21:17,240
Bah.

257
00:21:18,880 --> 00:21:20,279
Walls have ears.

258
00:21:20,279 --> 00:21:21,519
Someone might hear you.

259
00:21:28,160 --> 00:21:29,319
Can't you read, too?

260
00:21:30,648 --> 00:21:32,600
Young Madam
was too impatient to listen before,

261
00:21:32,630 --> 00:21:34,360
so you didn't
get the chance to tell her.

262
00:21:34,376 --> 00:21:35,750
Now you can find an opportunity

263
00:21:35,759 --> 00:21:36,799
to tell her.

264
00:21:37,559 --> 00:21:38,319
Maybe Young Madam

265
00:21:38,344 --> 00:21:40,568
will take a liking to you
and put you to good use.

266
00:21:43,200 --> 00:21:44,000
I wouldn't dare.

267
00:21:44,920 --> 00:21:47,160
I'm afraid Young Madam won't like me,

268
00:21:47,359 --> 00:21:49,319
and I'll only make Qingxiang dislike me.

269
00:21:52,216 --> 00:21:53,720
You're only bold with your own people.

270
00:21:54,008 --> 00:21:56,168
You only act tough in front of me.

271
00:21:56,216 --> 00:21:57,990
The moment you meet
someone truly formidable,

272
00:21:58,359 --> 00:21:59,599
you can barely get a word out.

273
00:22:09,640 --> 00:22:11,400
I'll keep your secret for you,

274
00:22:13,079 --> 00:22:13,880
but

275
00:22:14,880 --> 00:22:16,960
you'll have to listen to me from now on.

276
00:22:21,519 --> 00:22:22,559
You have my word.

277
00:22:26,119 --> 00:22:28,319
When I, Lv Ji'er,
give my word, I keep it.

278
00:22:28,519 --> 00:22:29,599
Absolutely.

279
00:22:43,119 --> 00:22:45,279
You can't just pick flowers
from the garden.

280
00:22:46,319 --> 00:22:47,720
Which household are you from?

281
00:22:49,519 --> 00:22:50,319
Miss,

282
00:22:50,720 --> 00:22:52,240
we're from Young Master's household.

283
00:22:53,759 --> 00:22:54,680
What a coincidence.

284
00:22:54,690 --> 00:22:55,990
I have a Buddhist scripture here.

285
00:22:56,000 --> 00:22:57,720
Please take it back
to Zhichun Hall for me.

286
00:23:01,940 --> 00:23:04,380
(Diamond Sutra)

287
00:23:09,279 --> 00:23:10,319
Take it back.

288
00:23:11,759 --> 00:23:13,680
Tell him Old Madam
sent it to Young Master.

289
00:23:13,790 --> 00:23:15,432
Find a suitable place to enshrine it.

290
00:23:18,839 --> 00:23:19,839
Don't worry.

291
00:23:20,240 --> 00:23:21,000
I'll personally

292
00:23:21,000 --> 00:23:23,096
deliver this Buddhist scripture
to Young Master.

293
00:23:32,980 --> 00:23:35,100
(Diamond Sutra)

294
00:23:41,119 --> 00:23:42,240
It's going to rain soon.

295
00:23:42,400 --> 00:23:43,559
Let's hurry back.

296
00:23:47,119 --> 00:23:48,200
I know a shortcut.

297
00:23:48,200 --> 00:23:49,279
Let's take it back.

298
00:23:49,559 --> 00:23:51,799
We can't let
this Buddhist scripture get wet.

299
00:23:52,079 --> 00:23:52,720
All right.

300
00:24:14,319 --> 00:24:15,440
Are you blind?

301
00:24:15,599 --> 00:24:17,039
Watch where you're going!

302
00:24:28,119 --> 00:24:29,359
You're the blind one!

303
00:24:30,312 --> 00:24:32,160
Why are you running like someone's died?

304
00:24:45,540 --> 00:24:46,860
(Outstanding debt: 1,000 taels.
Outstanding debt: 100 taels)

305
00:24:46,860 --> 00:24:49,300
(Outstanding debt: 500 taels.
Debtor: Liu San)

306
00:24:52,060 --> 00:24:54,380
(Diamond Sutra)

307
00:25:02,648 --> 00:25:05,150
Thank goodness the scripture
wasn't stained or damaged.

308
00:25:05,160 --> 00:25:07,368
Otherwise, how could
I answer to Young Master?

309
00:25:11,000 --> 00:25:11,920
Here's yours back.

310
00:25:12,799 --> 00:25:13,960
I'd rather pick my own.

311
00:25:16,440 --> 00:25:17,359
I'm heading back first.

312
00:25:18,119 --> 00:25:19,599
It's fine if the flowers get wet,

313
00:25:19,599 --> 00:25:20,680
but not the scripture.

314
00:25:21,160 --> 00:25:22,359
It's for Young Master.

315
00:25:22,480 --> 00:25:23,656
We can't be careless with it.

316
00:25:24,920 --> 00:25:25,519
Ji'er.

317
00:25:27,000 --> 00:25:27,720
What?

318
00:25:29,992 --> 00:25:31,720
I'm running an errand for Young Master.

319
00:25:32,799 --> 00:25:34,720
As soon as you get back,
take the scripture

320
00:25:34,720 --> 00:25:36,519
to Young Master
and Young Madam's room.

321
00:25:37,704 --> 00:25:38,830
You don't have to tell me.

322
00:25:40,968 --> 00:25:42,310
Take your time picking them up.

323
00:25:48,720 --> 00:25:50,519
As the head shopkeeper
of Rongbao Pavilion,

324
00:25:50,559 --> 00:25:53,079
you'd even take
the twenty taels from my family.

325
00:25:53,519 --> 00:25:55,119
Either you urgently need money,

326
00:25:55,119 --> 00:25:56,240
or

327
00:25:56,880 --> 00:25:58,880
someone is going
to inspect the accounts.

328
00:26:18,160 --> 00:26:19,240
Are there any errors

329
00:26:20,039 --> 00:26:21,279
in these account books?

330
00:26:25,319 --> 00:26:27,000
Yes. There are.

331
00:26:28,480 --> 00:26:29,480
Where?

332
00:26:30,799 --> 00:26:31,720
I don't know.

333
00:26:34,559 --> 00:26:35,920
I really don't know.

334
00:26:36,119 --> 00:26:37,519
These transaction accounts

335
00:26:37,519 --> 00:26:39,519
were all handed over to Qingxiang,

336
00:26:39,519 --> 00:26:40,680
Young Madam's maid.

337
00:26:40,880 --> 00:26:43,079
I only did as I was told.

338
00:26:43,519 --> 00:26:45,599
I really don't know.

339
00:26:45,680 --> 00:26:47,920
I really don't know.

340
00:27:01,599 --> 00:27:02,440
Why are you kneeling?

341
00:27:03,000 --> 00:27:03,799
Sit down and talk.

342
00:27:05,448 --> 00:27:06,550
Thank you, Young Master.

343
00:27:08,008 --> 00:27:09,160
Thank you, Young Master.

344
00:27:10,519 --> 00:27:12,359
Zijin, Young Madam's maid,

345
00:27:13,039 --> 00:27:15,000
brought me two jars
of Eight Treasure Tea.

346
00:27:16,070 --> 00:27:18,440
It's even made with white
chrysanthemums from the garden.

347
00:27:19,119 --> 00:27:20,720
It's perfect for this time of year.

348
00:27:23,519 --> 00:27:26,079
It clears internal heat
and relieves dryness.

349
00:27:27,319 --> 00:27:28,200
Try some.

350
00:27:28,839 --> 00:27:29,799
If you like it,

351
00:27:30,400 --> 00:27:31,559
take a few jars home.

352
00:27:33,400 --> 00:27:35,416
Thank you
for your generosity, Young Master.

353
00:28:02,160 --> 00:28:03,400
I've been away for many years.

354
00:28:04,799 --> 00:28:07,119
For now, I don't want
something this trivial

355
00:28:07,920 --> 00:28:09,440
to cause an argument
with Young Madam.

356
00:28:11,559 --> 00:28:12,559
I understand.

357
00:28:13,279 --> 00:28:15,119
I'll make sure Young Madam
never finds out.

358
00:28:16,880 --> 00:28:20,240
I burned this hand myself

359
00:28:20,640 --> 00:28:23,000
when I dozed off by the brazier.

360
00:28:24,519 --> 00:28:26,039
Young Master knows nothing about it.

361
00:28:26,160 --> 00:28:28,000
Young Master even praised my work

362
00:28:28,024 --> 00:28:29,640
and rewarded me with Eight Treasure Tea.

363
00:28:34,680 --> 00:28:35,880
You know what to say.

364
00:28:43,440 --> 00:28:44,240
Go.

365
00:28:45,464 --> 00:28:46,510
Thank you, Young Master.

366
00:28:47,304 --> 00:28:48,240
Thank you, Young Master.

367
00:30:01,119 --> 00:30:02,119
Hurry and work it out.

368
00:30:02,160 --> 00:30:03,559
How much did we make this month?

369
00:30:23,119 --> 00:30:23,799
What's wrong?

370
00:30:29,200 --> 00:30:30,000
Young Lady.

371
00:30:30,720 --> 00:30:32,480
I...

372
00:30:34,000 --> 00:30:35,279
Speak properly.

373
00:30:35,768 --> 00:30:37,660
If kowtowing and kneeling
could solve problems,

374
00:30:37,672 --> 00:30:38,750
I wouldn't be here.

375
00:30:44,279 --> 00:30:44,920
I...

376
00:30:46,319 --> 00:30:47,359
I took the wrong one.

377
00:30:47,799 --> 00:30:48,880
The wrong one?

378
00:30:52,559 --> 00:30:53,359
Then what's this?

379
00:30:55,519 --> 00:30:56,119
It's...

380
00:30:56,799 --> 00:30:58,160
It's a real Buddhist scripture.

381
00:31:01,832 --> 00:31:02,880
A Buddhist scripture?

382
00:31:03,144 --> 00:31:04,440
Then where's the account book?

383
00:31:05,839 --> 00:31:06,640
The account book...

384
00:31:07,720 --> 00:31:08,839
On my way back,

385
00:31:08,920 --> 00:31:10,008
I didn't want any trouble,

386
00:31:10,056 --> 00:31:11,368
so I deliberately took a shortcut.

387
00:31:14,856 --> 00:31:17,100
I ran into two third-class maids
from our household,

388
00:31:17,119 --> 00:31:18,240
Ji'er and Lanxiang.

389
00:31:18,839 --> 00:31:19,759
It must've been them.

390
00:31:19,896 --> 00:31:21,950
I mistakenly brought
the Buddhist scripture back,

391
00:31:21,960 --> 00:31:23,480
and they took the account book.

392
00:31:26,472 --> 00:31:27,720
Why are you still kneeling?

393
00:31:28,359 --> 00:31:29,359
Get Madam Feng

394
00:31:29,432 --> 00:31:30,550
and go catch the thieves.

395
00:31:31,600 --> 00:31:33,079
They dared to steal from their master.

396
00:31:33,440 --> 00:31:34,200
Tie them up,

397
00:31:34,200 --> 00:31:35,759
gag them, and sell them off.

398
00:31:38,184 --> 00:31:40,310
Are we supposed
to wait until Lin Jinqi returns

399
00:31:41,240 --> 00:31:42,839
and let him deal with us?

400
00:31:48,820 --> 00:31:50,580
(Diamond Sutra)

401
00:32:02,100 --> 00:32:04,980
(Feng Cang'er,
Zhao Xingtang's Housekeeper)

402
00:32:36,264 --> 00:32:38,088
Why haven't you taken
the Buddhist scripture

403
00:32:38,104 --> 00:32:39,224
to Young Madam yet?

404
00:32:39,768 --> 00:32:41,480
The Buddhist scripture
is for Young Master,

405
00:32:41,480 --> 00:32:43,039
not Young Madam.

406
00:32:43,839 --> 00:32:44,960
If Young Master isn't here,

407
00:32:45,440 --> 00:32:46,960
shouldn't you give it to Young Madam?

408
00:32:47,496 --> 00:32:49,550
The maid from Old Madam's
household made it clear.

409
00:32:49,550 --> 00:32:51,352
This Buddhist scripture
is for Young Master.

410
00:32:51,440 --> 00:32:53,496
Of course I'll personally
give it to Young Master.

411
00:32:53,580 --> 00:32:55,540
(Diamond Sutra)

412
00:32:56,000 --> 00:32:57,039
Is it pretty?

413
00:33:00,119 --> 00:33:01,480
I'm warning you, Xu Lanxiang.

414
00:33:01,576 --> 00:33:04,040
This is my errand. Don't even
think about taking it from me.

415
00:33:12,440 --> 00:33:14,350
You're just delivering
a Buddhist scripture.

416
00:33:14,350 --> 00:33:15,820
It's not like you're delivering
the Buddha himself.

417
00:33:15,830 --> 00:33:17,432
I wouldn't dream of taking it from you.

418
00:33:17,576 --> 00:33:18,790
At least you know your place.

419
00:33:24,152 --> 00:33:25,752
- Young Madam.
- Young Madam.

420
00:33:47,140 --> 00:33:49,780
(Diamond Sutra)

421
00:33:54,620 --> 00:33:57,540
(Outstanding debt: 1,000 taels.
Outstanding debt: 100 taels)

422
00:34:09,079 --> 00:34:11,239
What were you
just saying about my errand

423
00:34:11,239 --> 00:34:12,400
and your errand?

424
00:34:13,119 --> 00:34:14,119
What's going on?

425
00:34:18,760 --> 00:34:20,000
When we were picking flowers,

426
00:34:20,360 --> 00:34:22,760
we met a maid
from Old Madam's household.

427
00:34:23,400 --> 00:34:24,719
She instructed me

428
00:34:25,039 --> 00:34:27,119
to give this Buddhist scripture
to Young Master.

429
00:34:27,352 --> 00:34:29,896
She said Young Master
should find a place to enshrine it.

430
00:34:30,039 --> 00:34:31,360
On my way back,

431
00:34:31,480 --> 00:34:33,559
I accidentally bumped into Qingxiang

432
00:34:34,119 --> 00:34:35,119
and fell.

433
00:34:35,119 --> 00:34:36,239
My clothes got muddy.

434
00:34:36,328 --> 00:34:38,872
I was afraid of appearing
before Young Madam in such a state,

435
00:34:39,000 --> 00:34:41,760
so I thought I'd come back
and change into clean clothes first.

436
00:34:42,320 --> 00:34:43,559
Once I was presentable,

437
00:34:43,719 --> 00:34:45,159
I'd take the Buddhist scripture

438
00:34:45,280 --> 00:34:47,320
to Young Master
and Young Madam's room.

439
00:35:02,199 --> 00:35:03,000
And you?

440
00:35:04,079 --> 00:35:06,320
You're soaked through
and your feet are covered in mud.

441
00:35:07,280 --> 00:35:08,840
Where have you been?

442
00:35:10,159 --> 00:35:11,159
Young Madam,

443
00:35:11,160 --> 00:35:13,450
when I went to deliver
the chrysanthemums to the tea room,

444
00:35:13,460 --> 00:35:14,760
it started raining.

445
00:35:15,000 --> 00:35:16,599
Baogai told me to come back

446
00:35:16,599 --> 00:35:18,000
and change into clean clothes.

447
00:36:05,719 --> 00:36:07,480
Young Madam
can't bear children herself,

448
00:36:08,159 --> 00:36:09,480
yet she's so jealous.

449
00:36:09,624 --> 00:36:10,984
She knows full well that us...

450
00:36:13,760 --> 00:36:15,719
First Madam
sent me here for Young Master,

451
00:36:15,864 --> 00:36:17,896
yet Young Madam
keeps such a close watch on him.

452
00:36:17,928 --> 00:36:20,264
She won't give me
the slightest chance to get near him.

453
00:36:27,880 --> 00:36:29,079
I'm talking to you.

454
00:36:29,160 --> 00:36:30,920
Why aren't you saying anything?

455
00:36:36,239 --> 00:36:38,280
Baogai is still waiting
for me to get back to work.

456
00:36:40,760 --> 00:36:42,320
Perfect. Take that basket of flowers

457
00:36:42,320 --> 00:36:43,199
with you.

458
00:36:43,400 --> 00:36:44,840
Tell her I got caught in the rain

459
00:36:44,840 --> 00:36:47,624
and my chest feels uncomfortable,
so I need to lie down for a while.

460
00:36:59,599 --> 00:37:01,079
No wonder you mixed them up.

461
00:37:01,519 --> 00:37:02,840
(Diamond Sutra)
These two books

462
00:37:03,320 --> 00:37:04,360
would look the same

463
00:37:05,840 --> 00:37:07,639
to someone who can't read.

464
00:37:09,560 --> 00:37:12,110
I meant to disguise
the account book as a Buddhist scripture

465
00:37:12,184 --> 00:37:13,336
to keep others from noticing,

466
00:37:13,519 --> 00:37:15,639
but I ended up fooling myself.

467
00:37:16,679 --> 00:37:18,000
Put the account book away safely.

468
00:37:18,120 --> 00:37:19,280
As for the Buddhist scripture,

469
00:37:19,360 --> 00:37:20,239
when the rain stops,

470
00:37:20,480 --> 00:37:21,880
have Zijin deliver it.

471
00:37:22,480 --> 00:37:24,119
I don't want to see Lin Jinqi.

472
00:37:35,119 --> 00:37:37,800
Why didn't you
punish Ji'er and Lanxiang?

473
00:37:39,280 --> 00:37:40,119
Zijin,

474
00:37:41,768 --> 00:37:43,510
you've been with me
since you were little.

475
00:37:43,599 --> 00:37:45,599
You've grown taller, but no wiser.

476
00:37:46,280 --> 00:37:47,719
You're still as foolish as ever.

477
00:37:49,440 --> 00:37:51,320
If Ji'er had known it
was an account book,

478
00:37:51,559 --> 00:37:53,599
she never would've
gone back to change her clothes

479
00:37:53,679 --> 00:37:54,719
and tidy herself up.

480
00:37:55,360 --> 00:37:56,679
Since she had no idea what it was,

481
00:37:57,199 --> 00:37:58,679
why should we make a fuss

482
00:37:58,719 --> 00:37:59,559
and draw attention?

483
00:38:00,280 --> 00:38:00,960
Later,

484
00:38:01,016 --> 00:38:03,540
Young Madam will pass the Buddhist
scripture on to Young Master,

485
00:38:03,559 --> 00:38:06,079
and that will settle the matter.

486
00:38:08,639 --> 00:38:09,760
I understand now.

487
00:38:10,400 --> 00:38:11,480
Ji'er and Lanxiang,

488
00:38:11,719 --> 00:38:12,400
like me,

489
00:38:12,440 --> 00:38:13,360
can't read.

490
00:38:13,416 --> 00:38:15,544
They were convinced it
was a Buddhist scripture.

491
00:38:16,599 --> 00:38:18,239
One was bold enough

492
00:38:18,280 --> 00:38:20,600
to use it as a chance
to get close to Young Master,

493
00:38:20,664 --> 00:38:21,840
while the other was too timid

494
00:38:22,000 --> 00:38:23,400
to compete with Ji'er,

495
00:38:24,584 --> 00:38:26,320
so she simply
went to deliver the flowers.

496
00:38:41,160 --> 00:38:43,368
Do we have any more
of the new Eight Treasure Tea?

497
00:38:43,480 --> 00:38:44,280
Yes.

498
00:38:44,344 --> 00:38:46,424
Young Master
has finished his Eight Treasure Tea.

499
00:38:46,456 --> 00:38:48,030
You two, hurry

500
00:38:48,056 --> 00:38:49,280
and take some to Sanjue Hall.

501
00:38:49,400 --> 00:38:50,600
Young Master is waiting for it.

502
00:38:51,840 --> 00:38:52,679
We'll go right away.

503
00:39:01,280 --> 00:39:02,639
Qingxiang told us

504
00:39:02,760 --> 00:39:04,119
that we're third-class maids

505
00:39:04,920 --> 00:39:07,280
and can't enter the masters' rooms
to serve them personally.

506
00:39:08,159 --> 00:39:09,519
Can't you see no one's here?

507
00:39:09,800 --> 00:39:11,704
Then let's wait
for Baogai to come back.

508
00:39:12,056 --> 00:39:13,280
What if Young Master gets angry

509
00:39:13,400 --> 00:39:14,639
while we're waiting for her?

510
00:39:16,880 --> 00:39:17,639
Hurry.

511
00:39:17,800 --> 00:39:18,760
Young Master is waiting.

512
00:39:22,199 --> 00:39:22,880
Move.

513
00:39:23,039 --> 00:39:24,159
Don't ruin my chance.

514
00:40:15,199 --> 00:40:16,000
Where's Ji'er?

515
00:40:18,599 --> 00:40:20,480
A young servant
came with a message just now,

516
00:40:20,490 --> 00:40:22,860
saying Young Master was waiting
for his Eight Treasure Tea.

517
00:40:22,880 --> 00:40:24,540
Ji'er wanted
to wait for you to come back,

518
00:40:24,559 --> 00:40:26,519
but the young servant
kept urging her to hurry.

519
00:40:26,520 --> 00:40:28,220
Ji'er didn't dare
keep Young Master waiting,

520
00:40:28,230 --> 00:40:30,440
so she had no choice
but to take a jar of tea over.

521
00:40:32,808 --> 00:40:35,144
That must've been Jiugao,
Young Master's attendant.

522
00:40:42,639 --> 00:40:43,880
It's just a jar of tea.

523
00:40:44,670 --> 00:40:46,376
If Young Master needed it so urgently,

524
00:40:46,440 --> 00:40:48,079
Jiugao could've taken it back himself.

525
00:40:48,880 --> 00:40:50,440
Why make us deliver it?

526
00:40:51,679 --> 00:40:53,199
They really can't stand to see us idle.

527
00:41:04,760 --> 00:41:05,599
It's always safer

528
00:41:06,039 --> 00:41:08,079
to keep your feet firmly on the ground.

529
00:41:11,880 --> 00:41:12,519
Stay here.

530
00:41:12,630 --> 00:41:13,768
I'm going out for a while.

531
00:41:22,320 --> 00:41:23,639
I'll ask Qingxiang

532
00:41:23,704 --> 00:41:26,632
if we should send Young Master
a few more jars of Eight Treasure Tea.

533
00:41:59,280 --> 00:42:00,440
Look. What is this?

534
00:42:02,079 --> 00:42:02,920
Money?

535
00:42:04,079 --> 00:42:05,679
You're becoming a bigger fool.

536
00:42:05,880 --> 00:42:08,400
This is money
given to me by Young Master.

537
00:42:10,630 --> 00:42:12,776
You get money
just by delivering him a pot of tea?

538
00:42:13,400 --> 00:42:15,960
Young Master said
I'm capable and quick-witted.

539
00:42:18,880 --> 00:42:19,840
Young Master asked me

540
00:42:19,880 --> 00:42:21,400
why the Young Madam came to our place

541
00:42:21,400 --> 00:42:22,840
in the pouring rain yesterday.

542
00:42:23,320 --> 00:42:25,079
I told him about the sutra.

543
00:42:26,079 --> 00:42:28,599
Now, Young Master
will surely remember my name.

544
00:42:30,679 --> 00:42:32,840
Young Madam also remembers your name.

545
00:42:36,239 --> 00:42:37,559
So what if she does?

546
